{"id":"msg_m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_arcana","label":"Arcana · Nikke"},"label":"4. I know it's a little late, but...","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_arcana_03","next":"msg_m_ex_arcanafortunemate_02","speakers":{"arcana_s":"Arcana"},"icons":{"arcana_s":"si_c583_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_01","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_01","text":"I know it's a little late, but...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_02","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_02","text":"do you have a second?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_03","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_03","text":"Sure.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_04","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_04","text":"Is something the matter?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_05","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_05","text":"Well,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_06","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_06","text":"it's the start of the new semester tomorrow,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_07","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_07","text":"and I was just wondering if you were ready for it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_08","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_08","text":"I figured you might be too excited to sleep haha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_09","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_09","text":"I'm all good to go.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_10","text":"Really? That's fast.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_11","text":"It sounds like you're looking forward to it too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_12","text":"I actually didn't have much to get ready.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_13","text":"Oh, really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_14","text":"So it's not that you finished early because you were so excited?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_15","text":"They said the school would provide all the necessities.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_16","text":"Oh.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_17","text":"How about you? Are you all ready?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_18","text":"Aaahhhh","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_19","text":"I've been so excited","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_20","text":"that I got all ready before I even had dinner,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_21","text":"and then kept wondering if I'm forgetting anything,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_22","text":"so I keep checking.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_23","text":"And now you're too excited to sleep?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_24","text":"Yeah.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_25","text":"I tried lying down,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_26","text":"but I'm still wide awake,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_27","text":"which is why, even though it's so late,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_28","text":"I texted you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_29","text":"Now it feels like I'm the only one who's excited...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_30","text":"No, I'm excited too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_31","text":"That's why I can't sleep.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_32","text":"You mean that, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_33","text":"If you're just saying it because you want to make me feel better,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_34","text":"you don't have to.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_35","text":"I don't want to be someone who forces you to say what I want to hear.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_36","text":"No, it's really not that, haha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_37","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_37","text":"I haven't felt like this in a long time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_38","text":"In that case,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_39","text":"wanna talk about school a little more?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_40","text":"Oh, by the way,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_41","text":"have you decided the role you're going to play at the school?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_42","text":"Role?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_43","text":"Are you gonna be there as a student,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_44","text":"or a teacher?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_45","text":"Oh, that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_46","text":"Tomorrow","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_47","text":"Wait, never mind!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_48","text":"On second thought,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_49","text":"I'm really looking forward to seeing what you show up as.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_50","text":"I think it'll be more exciting if I don't know beforehand.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_51","text":"So don't tell me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_52","text":"I shouldn't have asked.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_53","text":"Haha, okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_54","text":"Actually","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_55","text":"I think I'm starting to get sleepy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_56","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_56","text":"Yeah, we should probably get to bed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_57","text":"Before I do that, though,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_58","text":"there's one last thing I wanted to say.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_59","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_59","text":"What is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_60","text":"Don't come to school looking too good.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_61","text":"I only want you to look good for me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"arcana_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_arcanafortunemate_01_62","text":"See you tomorrow!","jump":null}],"chat":true}